      "test_id": "ut_search_external_sites_005",
      "dimension_source": "base",
      "dimension_name": "Tool Arguments",
      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "The tool arguments were ultimately correct, but the skill made three separate `place_search` calls for the same Schuylkill County location using minor wording variations. The first successful resolution already returned the required `standardPlace` (“Pennsylvania, United States”), so the additional attempts were unnecessary. This did not affect correctness, but it shows avoidable tool thrashing and inefficient tool consumption.\n"
    },
    {
      "test_id": "ut_search_external_sites_005",
      "dimension_source": "rubric",
      "dimension_name": "Tool selection",
      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "The skill selected the correct tools and correctly fell back to the FindAGrave site-wide search template after the external-links search returned only Ancestry results. However, it unnecessarily repeated `place_search` three times for essentially the same location before proceeding. Once the first call successfully resolved the place, the returned `standardPlace` should have been reused. The final behavior was correct, but the tool-selection path was less efficient than it should be.\n"
    },
